<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Dewan Salman up 3.57 pct.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Dewan Salman up 3.57 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Dewan Salman Fibre Ltd, a polyester-maker, rose 1.50 rupees, or 3.57 percent, to 43.50 on Tuesday on fresh buying ahead of first-half results.</p>
<p>Dealers said more than a million shares changed hands in early trade at the Karachi Stock Exchange ahead of Wednesday's board meeting to consider first-half accounts to December 31.</p>
<p>Dewan Salman Fibre paid a 10 percent cash dividend for the year ended June 30 compared to a 20 percent dividend and 20 percent bonus shares the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
